Licence choice
--------------
CYD32 may reuse code from the Bruce firmware, which is published under the
GNU AGPL version 3 (its LICENSE carries no "or any later version" notice).
CYD32 therefore uses the same terms: AGPL-3.0-only.

Upstream project that code may be taken from
--------------------------------------------
Bruce firmware - https://github.com/pr3y/Bruce
  Reference commit: a59213f3ec6cd302fa32c2042b2700c9c24d991a
  Licence: AGPL-3.0
  This release contains NO file copied from Bruce. Any file later taken from
  Bruce keeps its original copyright and licence header and gains a dated
  "Modified by CYD32 contributors on YYYY-MM-DD" note (AGPL-3.0 section 5a),
  and is listed here. Offensive Bruce modules (deauth, BLE spam, beacon spam,
  jammers, evil portal, BadUSB, IR TV-B-Gone, ...) are never included; CI
  enforces this.

